 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What is the Longevity Shot made of?</p></span></div><div data-rid="c474ede5-1c02-4821-91d3-e43a3ef7dab3" class="r-1u9ii9k"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-gcpz0i" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rrj2:"><div data-rid="e72d3ca4-8207-4a1f-b5dd-a6c368a5081a" class="r-rzmg22"><div data-rid="6f103d0b-a73a-4548-a156-5f8f3e4729c7" class="r-17htc6s alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Longevity Shot is crafted entirely from all-natural ingredients, with 80% of the ingredients being non-GMO. It is gluten-free, vegan, caffeine-free, soy-free, and dairy-free, with no synthetic ingredients, artificial sweeteners, preservatives, or artificial colors/flavors. Each shot contains 18 calories per serving.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="ad8d3450-ab4b-41ab-84a4-5c9022662482" class="r-9z2avj" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="492ac9f0-befa-4f97-aaff-06e438113efb" aria-controls="replo-:R1bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1lcu4sh"><div data-rid="c79eeb74-0fed-4064-a33c-0944da86714b" class="r-wuj19c alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How should I take the Longevity Shot, and when is the best time?</p></span></div><div data-rid="014e0340-dc2e-4c4a-ae90-e37e21b2b87e" class="r-db6c6e"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-sbxu2o" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R1bj2:"><div data-rid="35ecc89c-41a3-4d78-9350-f1539f024e25" class="r-csqcde"><div data-rid="a1759fbd-c982-46d5-9a89-b0e822a46ff5" class="r-cc0w4l alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>For optimal results, we recommend taking two shots per week, at any time of the day. This schedule helps maintain NAD+ levels and activate sirtuins—proteins vital for cellular health, DNA repair, and metabolic function. This intermittent dosing supports long-term vitality and overall longevity, slowing the aging process without overwhelming your body.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="43cd2684-3e7a-4de1-a5c2-04798dc4af75" class="r-194q1mc" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="f1628839-4665-4f4d-b28b-492fe2fb1d05" aria-controls="replo-:R1rj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1qgjznh"><div data-rid="a110ae38-14cd-4671-af37-6691e0d945d1" class="r-qzucsc alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>When will I see results from the Longevity Shot?</p></span></div><div data-rid="a80d647a-351b-4e0a-811a-d05282ad55e8" class="r-ykhh1s"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-z93q86" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R1rj2:"><div data-rid="6f9e2b2a-51df-4472-938c-7f0addd26ce1" class="r-1i5lcg"><div data-rid="17014d85-a4e8-4e78-8fef-e334a0cf077e" class="r-13u9fx3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The timing of results can vary depending on your body and lifestyle. Many women begin to notice positive changes in energy, skin health, and overall well-being within the first 30 days of regular use.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="53b34a0c-caee-45dc-a8ae-be188bebb593" class="r-1iqznhu" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="5d32caf1-c646-4f03-8a64-130c0cd80c3d" aria-controls="replo-:R2bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-95fwfy"><div data-rid="4583043d-a5d7-4867-972f-f555b632c29a" class="r-f8bum0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How long should I continue taking the Longevity Shot?</p></span></div><div data-rid="e7348166-d6d5-4d0c-a4f8-63623cee2273" class="r-1a3gspq"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-egpbxv" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2bj2:"><div data-rid="ce8d53f5-2bcf-4ff6-9edb-e67cce19c29d" class="r-q72etv"><div data-rid="e8816bae-2676-459c-bed9-08e1346447f3" class="r-1nur62t alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The long-term benefits of the Longevity Shot—such as cellular health support and slowing the aging process—are best experienced over time with consistent use.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="5aec9871-c76f-4332-8650-48eee0776c9a" class="r-mg6ebl" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="bdb39878-5265-4be2-87ff-147b9fe29d06" aria-controls="replo-:R2rj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1tlde8g"><div data-rid="093ae053-fa9e-4b82-ae32-b9407daff058" class="r-seetk1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Are there any side effects of interactions with medications?</p></span></div><div data-rid="f1b63736-3451-4031-a474-48ea08037f8e" class="r-1bs2x23"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1vogsa8" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2rj2:"><div data-rid="03aa44bd-bd67-461f-b8fb-44b0d51894cc" class="r-1614dgc"><div data-rid="5c6f0986-09c4-43ce-8fb3-5bbb1c2345ac" class="r-wrd8s8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The natural ingredients in the Longevity Shot are generally well-tolerated, but everyone is unique. If you’re taking any prescription medications or have a medical condition, particularly autoimmune conditions, we encourage you to consult your healthcare provider before starting the Longevity Shot.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="346bd25d-6e46-4cd7-a170-65dbda1e06b5" class="r-1n0avab" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="95125565-6243-460f-8c88-ffbada5475fc" aria-controls="replo-:R3bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1o1use8"><div data-rid="0477f764-dd32-483f-9f63-fbb187cad09a" class="r-jq9kuz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Does the Longevity Shot contain sugar or alcohol?</p></span></div><div data-rid="c7bf3c02-3159-4802-b86e-442df7af9968" class="r-2z2ecg"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1szc206" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R3bj2:"><div data-rid="ef191908-6427-475f-927c-35c0854bbd36" class="r-p4eilc"><div data-rid="cff9f9f1-4e1c-4595-93e9-5adc8131a4b2" class="r-1m5e2q3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The Longevity Shot contains 2.5 grams of natural sugar from apple and grape juice concentrate. It is also lightly sweetened with steviol glycosides, a natural sweetener derived from the Stevia rebaudiana plant that is sugar and calorie-free. It is alcohol-free.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="7a98c4e0-6eec-479f-8741-ffbaa629e952" class="r-17ykk7q" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="bdc49584-a699-4b82-96e4-5bc2afde0596" aria-controls="replo-:R3rj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-6yk2xl"><div data-rid="e2924e90-27e4-4fc9-afe0-e30d62ecbb99" class="r-69rl6j alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I take the Longevity Shot if I’m pregnant or breastfeeding?</p></span></div><div data-rid="dec6f560-58d6-47b5-9f4f-e8ef35d683b6" class="r-1us7g91"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-jqswp8" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R3rj2:"><div data-rid="c77bfbfa-077b-4411-84c5-9d12cbd8b8f0" class="r-1nsrq7l"><div data-rid="c26c5aaa-5120-4617-9607-e5a105e286fc" class="r-qkxpei alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>While the Longevity Shot is made with natural ingredients, we always recommend that pregnant or breastfeeding women consult their healthcare provider to ensure it aligns with their unique health needs during this time.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="36d8d5fb-df31-4287-bb48-abb0fe1c7c83" class="r-17nwt2t" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="74ff5f50-f528-4dff-8161-deb800a1f9d2" aria-controls="replo-:R4bj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-18ob1rk"><div data-rid="1cd0f499-9e64-489d-aaf7-203aac3f43ab" class="r-1yczd0e alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is the Longevity Shot suitable for children or teenagers?</p></span></div><div data-rid="2dfb8c6a-800e-4f18-a55a-4fa9217eaeb2" class="r-j3kczb"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 1